    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d540">

                <pb facs="0591" n="475" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg475"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/1221.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-28T11:00:00-04:49">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 28, 1915—11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>At 10.30 mob invaded French Legation, took out President, killed and dismembered
                    him before Legation gates. Hysterical crowds parading streets with portions of
                    his body on poles.</p>
                <p>U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi> entering harbor.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
